error[trioxide(wasm-ineligible)]: `size` is forced into WASM but can't be compiled: parameter `text` may be a string; only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]` and plain-data objects can cross the boundary
  --> input.ts:2:15 `text: string`
      `size` parameter `text` may be a string; only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]` and plain-data objects can cross the boundary
  help: only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]`, plain-data objects, local control flow, arithmetic, `Math.*` and calls to other compilable functions can be compiled (docs/PLAN.md §5); remove the directive to keep it in JS
